 "content_html": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">סוף סוף הודעה קצת שונה, רק מבשרת על סוף התקלה בהצגת מסמכים</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">מדובר היה באירוע כל כך חריג, שגם בפורום לשכת עו\"ד בישרו על סוף התקלה</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/image.png?ssl=1\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5388\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"288\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/image.png?resize=640%2C288&amp;ssl=1\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/image.png?resize=1024%2C461&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/image.png?resize=300%2C135&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/image.png?resize=768%2C345&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/image.png?resize=1536%2C691&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/image.png?resize=1200%2C540&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/image.png?w=2048&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/image.png?w=1280&amp;ssl=1 1280w, https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/image.png?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w\" width=\"640\"/></a></figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">וגם דוברת בית המשפט טרחה בעצמה להפיץ הודעה לסיכום התקלה</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/image-1.png?ssl=1\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5390\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"847\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/image-1.png?resize=640%2C847&amp;ssl=1\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/o